    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2048 - Dungeons</strong> is a <strong>Roguelite puzzle game</strong>. Venture into the perilous dungeon of Blockshire as you uncover the mysteries surrounding the place. Help the town and earn powerful rewards for your next journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of your adventure, you must choose from four heroes (or more), each with unique abilities that can help you conquer this dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/5372b86cc31eef57a47fc629b430886a.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/5372b86cc31eef57a47fc629b430886a.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/5372b86cc31eef57a47fc629b430886a.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to use your 2048 knowledge. To win, merge blocks to match your Enemy's HP level. Use strategy, powers, and even the board itself to defeat everyone in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/3b903d7410ad701390bd933d7bfb84e4.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/3b903d7410ad701390bd933d7bfb84e4.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/3b903d7410ad701390bd933d7bfb84e4.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, your enemies won\u2019t just stand by. Monsters can set traps on the blocks, hindering your vision, movement, dealing damage, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/1b3ef4b7f4eabd1a618db597309b1a12.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/1b3ef4b7f4eabd1a618db597309b1a12.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/1b3ef4b7f4eabd1a618db597309b1a12.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve the Town</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the town of Blockshire prosper and upgrade its establishments. Each upgrade can help you in some way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/db4db0e648a0188edf9578c857cef487.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/db4db0e648a0188edf9578c857cef487.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/db4db0e648a0188edf9578c857cef487.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the <strong>Story Mode</strong>, you can test your skills in something quicker and more straightforward in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>. Or, if you have the endurance, face the ultimate challenge in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Three game modes:</i> Story Mode, Arcade Mode, and Endless Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Procedural Dungeon:</i> No attempt is the same as the previous one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Progressive difficulty:</i> New floor, new dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Rebuild Blockshire:</i> Recruit heroes, upgrade establishments, and build your town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Variety of enemies:</i> Over 60 different enemies scattered across the 3 dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Seed:</i> Use seeds in Arcade Mode to replay the same dungeon, or share it with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Variety of traps:</i> Various traps to hinder your progress. From a dark cloud that blocks vision to chains that prevent block movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>And more...</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2048 - Dungeons</strong> is a <strong>Roguelite puzzle game</strong>. Venture into the perilous dungeon of Blockshire as you uncover the mysteries surrounding the place. Help the town and earn powerful rewards for your next journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of your adventure, you must choose from four heroes (or more), each with unique abilities that can help you conquer this dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/5372b86cc31eef57a47fc629b430886a.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/5372b86cc31eef57a47fc629b430886a.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/5372b86cc31eef57a47fc629b430886a.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to use your 2048 knowledge. To win, merge blocks to match your Enemy's HP level. Use strategy, powers, and even the board itself to defeat everyone in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/3b903d7410ad701390bd933d7bfb84e4.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/3b903d7410ad701390bd933d7bfb84e4.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/3b903d7410ad701390bd933d7bfb84e4.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, your enemies won\u2019t just stand by. Monsters can set traps on the blocks, hindering your vision, movement, dealing damage, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/1b3ef4b7f4eabd1a618db597309b1a12.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/1b3ef4b7f4eabd1a618db597309b1a12.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/1b3ef4b7f4eabd1a618db597309b1a12.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve the Town</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the town of Blockshire prosper and upgrade its establishments. Each upgrade can help you in some way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/db4db0e648a0188edf9578c857cef487.poster.avif?t=1749053402\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/db4db0e648a0188edf9578c857cef487.webm?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834690/extras/db4db0e648a0188edf9578c857cef487.mp4?t=1749053402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the <strong>Story Mode</strong>, you can test your skills in something quicker and more straightforward in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>. Or, if you have the endurance, face the ultimate challenge in <strong>Endless Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Three game modes:</i> Story Mode, Arcade Mode, and Endless Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Procedural Dungeon:</i> No attempt is the same as the previous one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Progressive difficulty:</i> New floor, new dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Rebuild Blockshire:</i> Recruit heroes, upgrade establishments, and build your town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Variety of enemies:</i> Over 60 different enemies scattered across the 3 dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Seed:</i> Use seeds in Arcade Mode to replay the same dungeon, or share it with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Variety of traps:</i> Various traps to hinder your progress. From a dark cloud that blocks vision to chains that prevent block movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>And more...</i></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A game that mixes 2048 puzzle mechanics with a roguelite style of play, creating deadly battles where staying calm and thinking strategically are essential for victory. Make improvements, train your character, recruit allies and try your luck in the terrible dungeon of Blockshire.",
